    "headline": "HWM Q2 Deep Dive: Aerospace and Gas Turbine Demand Drive Upward Guidance",
    "summary": "Aerospace and defense company Howmet (NYSE:HWM) reported Q2 CY2026 results exceeding the market’s revenue expectations, with sales up 24.1% year on year to $2.55 billion. On top of that, next quarter’s revenue guidance ($2.58 billion at the midpoint) was surprisingly good and 4.1% above what analysts were expecting. Its non-GAAP profit of $1.33 per share was 6.7% above analysts’ consensus estimates.",
